<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>小柔｜台北・台中・高雄</title>
  <meta name="description" content="小柔 — 台北、台中、高雄。慢慢挑，私訊聊聊。" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@400;500;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <div class="noise" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <header class="hero">
    <div class="hero__veil"></div>
    <div class="hero__content">
      <p class="brand">小柔</p>
      <h1 class="headline">今晚想認識誰？先慢慢挑</h1>
      <p class="support">台北・台中・高雄｜看對眼再私訊</p>
      <div class="hero__cta">
        <a class="btn" href="#taipei">往下看看</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="region" id="taipei" data-city="台北">
      <div class="region__head">
        <h2>台北</h2>
        <p>北區這幾位，先認識一下</p>
        <a class="line-btn" href="https://line.me/ti/p/~ty1xi" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">私訊聊聊：ty1xi</a>
      </div>
      <div class="grid" data-region="taipei"></div>
    </section>

    <section class="region" id="taichung" data-city="台中">
      <div class="region__head">
        <h2>台中</h2>
        <p>中部這幾位，回訊通常很快</p>
        <a class="line-btn" href="https://line.me/ti/p/~p50sp" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">私訊聊聊：p50sp</a>
      </div>
      <div class="grid" data-region="taichung"></div>
    </section>

    <section class="region" id="kaohsiung" data-city="高雄">
      <div class="region__head">
        <h2>高雄</h2>
        <p>南部這幾位，夜晚也常在線</p>
        <a class="line-btn" href="https://line.me/ti/p/~kt7m4" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">私訊聊聊：kt7m4</a>
      </div>
      <div class="grid" data-region="kaohsiung"></div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="footer">
    <p class="footer__brand">小柔</p>
    <p class="footer__note">僅供成年使用者瀏覽。</p>
  </footer>

  <script src="app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
